        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Stressed? Feel like losing a few extra pounds? Don't have enough time to go to the gym? Then buy this game and get the body you've always dreamed of without leaving your room!\n\nA sports and diet programme developed by Valerie Orsoni that is completely customizable (physical criteria, availability and goals)\nMore than 100 aerobic and muscle-toning exercises: Low and High impact Aerobic, Arms/Shoulders/Bust/Legs/Abs/Gluts and Total Body Conditioning.\nA fitness encyclopedia so you can exercise properly.\nComplete coaching or on-demand sports sessions.",
